    {
      "bbox": [
        357,
        1324,
        1836,
        1496
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The City's Legislative Representative in Albany, acting on my behalf, will be referring to you for comment and recommendations bills which have been passed by the Legislature and which are before the Governor for executive action.",
