        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        348,
        1917,
        1870,
        2177
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "All reports on such legislation must be made in strict compliance with my Executive Order Number 15, dated January 15th, 1955, this Executive Order, and in no other manner. Inquiries that you may receive for recommendations on legislation from other than an authorized City Source shall be replied to in accordance with the standard City procedure outlined herein and the inquirer should be so advised.",
